  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive Mitigation and Preparedness in Action II (IMPACT II) Republic of the Marshall Islands</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Inclusive Mitigation and Preparedness in Action II (IMPACT II) project is for government and communities to demonstrate strengthened resilience and adaptive capacity in the context of climate change and natural hazards.  The proposed project will work at the community level, as well as the state level, and will aim to enhance coordination between community, NGOs, and government partners.</narrative>
  </description>
